{"src":"id","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":230100,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"id","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":7932.525294,"text":"zona sejengan bagaimanapun cara kerjanya sama seperti satu negara dalam hal ini"},{"kind":"text","t":8602.547666,"text":"The convergence zone, regardless of how it works, is the same as a single country in this case."},{"kind":"audio","t":8694.048190000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8698.639986,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8703.791993,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8709.231155000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":8714.467091,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":860},{"kind":"audio","t":8715.174739,"samples":1160,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":17466.878269999997,"text":"Berada di puncak salah satu gunung di utara kota Mekah, gua tersebut benar-benar terisolasi dari seluruh dunia."},{"kind":"text","t":18307.020978,"text":"Located on the summit of one of the mountains north of Mecca, the cave is completely isolated from the rest of the world."},{"kind":"audio","t":18406.176179,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18411.311385999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18416.481292,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":860},{"kind":"audio","t":18422.006503,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18427.315586999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":18431.851994,"samples":30560,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":670},{"kind":"input","t":27277.214814,"text":"Orang-orang sekarang menulis pesan di layar komputer tidak pernah harus menggunakan rautan"},{"kind":"text","t":27814.743883,"text":"People these days writing messages on computer screens never have to use typewriters."},{"kind":"audio","t":27904.628913,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27909.889208999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27915.277872,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1260},{"kind":"audio","t":27920.495587999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":290,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27924.622421,"samples":28528,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":610},{"kind":"input","t":38092.833912,"text":"Wisatawan yang berpergian ke negara-negara berpajak yang tinggi kadang-kadang bisa menghemat uang"},{"kind":"text","t":38589.686708,"text":"Tourists who travel to countries with high taxes can sometimes save money."},{"kind":"audio","t":38677.456902000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38682.645058,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38687.922903000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":38693.327336,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":850},{"kind":"audio","t":38693.637451,"samples":2728,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":43071.74257,"text":"untuk produk-produk seperti minuman beralkohol dan tembakau."},{"kind":"text","t":43423.509906,"text":"for products such as alcoholic drinks and tobacco."},{"kind":"audio","t":43508.563984,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43513.76799,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":43518.72423,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":800},{"kind":"audio","t":43519.045475,"samples":696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":54289.326494,"text":"Tumbuhan membuat makanan mereka dari matahari melalui fotosintesis. Mereka juga memberikan tempat berteduh."},{"kind":"text","t":54748.828112,"text":"Plants produce their food from sunlight through photosynthesis. They also provide shelter."},{"kind":"audio","t":54835.411406,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54840.454664000004,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1060},{"kind":"audio","t":54845.994555000005,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":54846.402838,"samples":9096,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":54914.726956000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":54917.892565,"samples":25432,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":510},{"kind":"input","t":63870.029372000005,"text":"Rumah sakit telah mengikuti protokol untuk mengendali infeksi, termasuk memisahkan pasien dari orang lain untuk menjaga kemungkinan menulari mereka."},{"kind":"text","t":64652.98444300001,"text":"Hospitals have followed protocols to control infections, including separating patients from others to prevent the risk of infecting them."},{"kind":"audio","t":64759.239999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64764.508994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64769.703089999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":64774.894376,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":300,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":64780.297989,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":64785.31271900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":320,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":64790.846109000006,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":980},{"kind":"audio","t":64791.037666000004,"samples":5824,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":71970.722994,"text":"Pekerjaan yang dilakukan sebagian besar bersifat teoretis"},{"kind":"text","t":72323.836418,"text":"The work done is mostly theoretical in nature."},{"kind":"audio","t":72413.842606,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72419.15935100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":72423.059078,"samples":27464,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":80420.594983,"text":"Tetapi program ini ditulis untuk mensimulasikan pengamatan yang dilakukan terhadap galaksi Sagittarius."},{"kind":"text","t":80944.173698,"text":"But this program was written to simulate observations of the Sagittarius galaxy."},{"kind":"audio","t":81033.081693,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81038.331829,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81043.80236100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81049.147384,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":81050.68754,"samples":15328,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":91034.041163,"text":"Bahasa resmi Barcelona adalah Katalan dan Spanyol. Hampir separuh penduduknya lebih suka berbicara dalam bahasa Katalan."},{"kind":"text","t":91495.132665,"text":"The official languages of Barcelona are Catalan and Spanish. Nearly half of its population prefers to speak in Catalan."},{"kind":"audio","t":91575.884713,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91578.871065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1050},{"kind":"audio","t":91580.476949,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91581.046799,"samples":19296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":240},{"kind":"audio","t":91657.71905300001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":91663.000847,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91668.340951,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91670.45985700001,"samples":17496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":130},{"kind":"input","t":96174.725672,"text":"Sebagian besar memahaminya dan hampir semua orang mengetahui bahasa Sepanyol."},{"kind":"text","t":96587.38632,"text":"Most people understand it, and almost everyone knows Spanish."},{"kind":"audio","t":96677.91609,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96682.89291000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96688.38590200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96689.997506,"samples":15696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":110},{"kind":"input","t":103636.78919,"text":"Di sebagian area, mau seair selama semenit dianggap cukup, sedangkan di area lainnya butuh beberapa menit."},{"kind":"text","t":104333.93815100001,"text":"In some areas, a minute of watering is considered sufficient, while in other areas several minutes are needed."},{"kind":"audio","t":104436.12863400001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104441.055784,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104446.577325,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104451.820881,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104457.40539100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104460.55319,"samples":23360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":310},{"kind":"input","t":110686.825509,"text":"Tanaman terlihat paling baik saat berada di lingkungan alami, jadi"},{"kind":"text","t":111067.354035,"text":"Plants look best in their natural environment, so"},{"kind":"audio","t":111149.250065,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111154.439771,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":111156.144724,"samples":17864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":170},{"kind":"input","t":114798.780392,"text":"Tahan godaan untuk mengambil spesimen meskipun cuma satu."},{"kind":"text","t":115337.876242,"text":"Resist the temptation to collect a specimen, even if it’s just one."},{"kind":"audio","t":115424.358928,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115429.536894,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115434.800519,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115438.368082,"samples":26496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":500},{"kind":"input","t":126249.405962,"text":"Pada tahun 1920-an, sikap yang berlaku pada kebanyakan warga dan bangsa adalah pasifisme."},{"kind":"text","t":126937.13927500001,"text":"In the 1920s, the attitude held by most people and nations was pacifism."},{"kind":"audio","t":127034.123872,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127039.119662,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127044.418986,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127049.78842,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127052.893649,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":138674.906676,"text":"Mosasaurus merupakan predator puncak di masanya sehingga ia tidak takut apapun kecuali sama Mosasaurus"},{"kind":"text","t":139377.595768,"text":"Mosasaurus was the apex predator of its time, so it feared nothing except another Mosasaurus."},{"kind":"audio","t":139471.605073,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139476.73307000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139481.84981800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139487.349339,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":139492.678073,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":139494.14669,"samples":14360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":30},{"kind":"input","t":152351.490362,"text":"Sejak Asuncion berdiri tahun 1537, Paraguay telah berhasil mempertahankan banyak karakter dan identitas aslinya."},{"kind":"text","t":153136.45396800002,"text":"Since its founding in 1537, Paraguay has managed to preserve many of its original characteristics and identity."},{"kind":"audio","t":153233.190018,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153238.396544,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153243.530312,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153248.988484,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153254.274778,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153259.616252,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":153262.438587,"samples":21192,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":220},{"kind":"input","t":160103.650723,"text":"Penyakit dibawa oleh babi, kemudian berpindah ke manusia lewat nyamuk."},{"kind":"text","t":160601.041774,"text":"The disease is carried by pigs and then transmitted to humans through mosquitoes."},{"kind":"audio","t":160695.658819,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":160700.780857,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":160706.15231,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":160711.680801,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":160711.999556,"samples":7528,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":170449.942705,"text":"Sebagian besar teleskop riset modern merupakan fasilitas raksasa di wilayah terpencil dengan kondisi"},{"kind":"text","t":170974.238273,"text":"Most modern research telescopes are giant facilities in remote areas with harsh conditions."},{"kind":"audio","t":171065.212536,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171070.291295,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171075.485101,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1140},{"kind":"audio","t":171080.789765,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":171086.246697,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1170},{"kind":"audio","t":171086.632741,"samples":8960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":172907.617606,"text":"atmosfer yang sesuai"},{"kind":"text","t":173087.451867,"text":"suitable atmosphere"},{"kind":"audio","t":173177.500105,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":360,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":173178.755945,"samples":17032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":184763.552252,"text":"Orang-orang mungkin tidak menduga bahwa pengertian dan kesabaran juga diperlukan bagi pelancong yang pulang"},{"kind":"text","t":185322.298955,"text":"People might not expect that understanding and patience are also needed for travelers returning home."},{"kind":"audio","t":185415.761078,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":185417.102086,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":185418.587982,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":185420.19188600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":185421.81845,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":840},{"kind":"audio","t":185421.906679,"samples":2960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":193343.837653,"text":"Jadi notasi itu kemungkinan besar disisikan cuma sebagai level"},{"kind":"text","t":193753.696306,"text":"So that notation was likely included just as a level."},{"kind":"audio","t":193835.846092,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":193837.258249,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":193838.672166,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":193838.867203,"samples":10296,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":202973.697235,"text":"Namun ada banyak hal tentang burung yang masih terlihat seperti dinosaurus."},{"kind":"text","t":203412.061498,"text":"Yet there are many aspects of birds that still resemble dinosaurs."},{"kind":"audio","t":203501.137812,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":203506.412177,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":203511.660393,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":203514.217072,"samples":20496,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":290},{"kind":"input","t":216769.866083,"text":"Hampir semua pantainya berpasir dengan tempat berenang yang aman, dan sebagian besar mempunyai tempat teduh yang diperoleh dari deretan pohon Pohu Tukawa."},{"kind":"text","t":217724.610602,"text":"Almost all of its beaches have sandy shores with safe swimming areas, and most have shaded spots provided by rows of Pohu Tukawa trees."},{"kind":"audio","t":217830.895739,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":440,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":217836.267952,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":217841.592087,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":217846.632215,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":217852.159406,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":217857.537469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":217862.124966,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1130},{"kind":"audio","t":217862.440371,"samples":8824,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":225777.300529,"text":"Duval yang menikah dengan dua anak-anak yang sudah dewasa tidak meninggalkan kesan yang mendalam bagi Miller."},{"kind":"text","t":226448.862533,"text":"Duval, who was married with two grown children, did not leave a deep impression on Miller."},{"kind":"audio","t":226555.291967,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":226560.499133,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":226565.531502,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":226571.006884,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":226574.437938,"samples":23728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":320},{"kind":"input","t":227935.458338,"text":"yang kisahnya terkait"},{"kind":"text","t":228206.778404,"text":"whose story is related to it"},{"kind":"audio","t":228281.548489,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":228282.371956,"samples":26632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":550},{"kind":"close","t":240104.747512,"code":1005}]}